1
00:00:00,764 --> 00:00:02,264
(Sheldon:)Are you still
mad at me?

2
00:00:02,267 --> 00:00:06,007
(Leonard:)Yes, we missed our lecture,
we were almost arrested,

3
00:00:06,004 --> 00:00:08,004
(Leonard:)and you got me locked
in a room with a man

4
00:00:08,006 --> 00:00:12,346
(Leonard:)who forced his tongue down the
throat of a stuffed Wookiee.

5
00:00:13,644 --> 00:00:15,714
(Sheldon:)Boy, some people are just
glass-half-empty.

6
00:00:16,647 --> 00:00:18,317
(Leonard:)The glass is
empty, Sheldon.

7
00:00:18,316 --> 00:00:19,646
(Leonard:)It's completely empty.

8
00:00:19,651 --> 00:00:21,651
(Leonard:)If you gave that glass to a
man who was dying of thirst,

9
00:00:21,653 --> 00:00:23,653
(Leonard:)he would be dead,
do you know why?

10
00:00:23,655 --> 00:00:26,625
(Sheldon:)Before I answer,
was he a smoker?

11
00:00:31,529 --> 00:00:33,529
(Sheldon:)I think you're looking
at this all wrong.

12
00:00:33,532 --> 00:00:36,202
(Leonard:)Fine, then tell me
how I should be looking at it.

13
00:00:36,201 --> 00:00:40,501
(Sheldon:)Well, not only did we go to
Skywalker Ranch, we got in.

14
00:00:40,505 --> 00:00:42,805
(Sheldon:)No one we know
can say that.

15
00:00:42,807 --> 00:00:46,147
(Sheldon:)And for all the times
you find me irritating,

16
00:00:46,144 --> 00:00:49,214
(Sheldon:)today you got to watch
someone shoot me with a Taser.

17
00:00:52,550 --> 00:00:55,320
(Leonard:)That part was pretty good.

18
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,020
(Leonard:)See?

19
00:00:57,022 --> 00:00:59,952
(Leonard:)You did flop around a lot.

20
00:00:59,958 --> 00:01:02,288
(Sheldon:)I'll take your word for it.

